态诗意。中景是她半身与裙摆的优雅轮廓，光影在纱衣上勾勒出柔和的明暗过渡，凸显肌肤与布料的质感。背景为深邃的工业废墟或古旧殿堂，铁梁与阴影交错，仅一束天光自高处倾泻而下，精准照亮她周身，形成强烈明暗对比，营造出神圣而孤寂的氛围。构图采用中近景特写，人物居画面中央偏左，视线自然引向其凝望远方的眼神，引导观者沉浸于她内心的幽微世界。光影以高对比冷调为主，光束如神迹般穿透黑暗，照亮她如雪的发丝与衣裙，形成梦幻般的光晕与粒子感，氛围静谧、空灵、略带忧伤，似在诉说一个被遗忘的神话或梦境。整体画面如电影镜头般细腻，充满东方幻想与现代艺术融合的美学张力，仿佛用业余设备在废墟中捕捉到的神祇幻影，真实而虚幻，温柔而苍凉。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 400, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [406.6141357421875, 465.18719482421875], "pos": [1447.5133056640625, 720.450927734375], "id": 262, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 25}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [388], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "mask", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"name": "original_size", "label": "原始大小", "type": "BOX", "localized_name": "original_size"}, {"name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["original", 1, 1, "crop", "lanczos", "8", "longest", 1920, "#000000"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 543, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "mask", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "宽高比"}, {"widget": {"name": "proportional_width"}, "name": "proportional_width", "label": "proportional_width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "比例宽"}, {"widget": {"name": "proportional_height"}, "name": "proportional_height", "label": "proportional_h